error[E0265]: a narrowing binding is allowed only in the condition of an 'if'
  --> $DIR/narrowing-parentheses.nra:12:19
   |
12 |     if ((shape is circle: Circle)) {
   |                   ^^^^^^ 'circle' cannot be bound here
   |
   = note: a narrowing 'x is circle: T' must be the whole condition, or an operand of the '&&' chain that is the whole condition, outside parentheses
   = help: move the narrowing to the top level of the condition, or test with 'is' here and narrow in an 'if' inside

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0265`.
